      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community’s first post office opened in 1895 from Williams’s store, marking Doerun’s transition from informal settlement to organized locale.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
